### ---------- Week 10: HTTP Basic, sign-up, 401 in ApiError (slide 21) ----------

### 42. POST room, no login (expect 401, "login required")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Secret Room", "capacity": 6 }

### 43. Sign up lee / lee12345 (expect 201, id, username, role)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lee", "password": "lee12345" }

### 44. Sign up lee again (expect 409, username lee is taken)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lee", "password": "lee12345" }

### 45. Sign up Lee! / short (expect 400, two fieldErrors)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "Lee!", "password": "short" }

