POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic bGVlOndyb25n
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hacker Room", "capacity": 4 }

### 48. GET rooms, no login (expect 200, 4 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 49. GET /api/auth/me as lee (expect 200, lee, ROLE_USER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Basic bGVlOmxlZTEyMzQ1

### ---------- Week 10: Tokens: login, Bearer, broken token (slide 28) ----------

### 50. Log in (expect 200, accessToken)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lee", "password": "lee12345" }

> {%
  client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken);
  if (response.body.refreshToken) {
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refreshToken);
  }
%}

### 51. Login, wrong password (expect 401, "wrong username or password")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "lee", "password": "wrongpassword" }

### 52. Who am I? (expect 200, lee, no ROLE_USER)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 53. POST room with the token (expect 201, Location: /api/rooms/6)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Boardroom", "capacity": 10 }

### 54. POST room, broken token (expect 401, "token is invalid or expired")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer broken.token.here
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Broken Room", "capacity": 5 }

### 55. GET rooms, broken token (expect 401, "token is invalid or expired")
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer broken.token.here

